WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:13.234
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.222
[muzak]
LA LA LA LA LA! C'mon...

00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:21.259
[muzak]

00:00:21.259 --> 00:00:22.424
Uhh...

00:00:22.424 --> 00:00:24.067
[Geiger counter ticks]
Why is this all green?

00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:27.594
FUCK! THIS IS RADIOACTIVE!

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.000
ABORT! ABORT!

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.567
WHY IS NOTHING HAPPENING?!

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:33.369
SHIT!

00:00:33.369 --> 00:00:35.204
I KNEW THIS WAS A TRAP!

00:00:35.204 --> 00:00:38.776
THIS IS A RADIOACTIVE
ROACH MOTEL... FOR PEOPLE!

00:00:38.776 --> 00:00:40.343
[alarm blares]
FUCKING SHIT!

00:00:40.343 --> 00:00:41.521
[alarm blares]

00:00:41.521 --> 00:00:43.087
I'VE GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE!

00:00:43.087 --> 00:00:46.145
I DON'T WANT TO DIE HERE
SUCKING DOWN GAMMA RAYS!

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.010
LOOK OUT!

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.167
WHAT ARE YOU FUCKING MORONS DOING HERE?!

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:51.567
GET OUT OF HERE!

00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:54.943
I'M NOT THE ENEMY!

00:00:54.943 --> 00:00:57.396
RADIATION'S THE INVISIBLE ENEMY!

00:00:57.396 --> 00:01:00.612
AND I'M LOST AND... SCARED, DAMMIT!

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:03.866
YOU KNOW WHAT THE NUMBER ONE
REGRET OF DYING PEOPLE IS?

00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:06.808
IT'S, "I REGRET PLAYING NEAR ALL
THAT RADIOACTIVE WASTE

00:01:06.808 --> 00:01:08.700
"BECAUSE NOW I'M FUCKING DYING!"

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:09.729
[machine gun fire]
WHERE AM I?!

00:01:09.729 --> 00:01:11.244
[machine gun fire, agrunts howling]

00:01:11.244 --> 00:01:13.500
So, are you guys fighting
over me, is that it?

00:01:15.031 --> 00:01:16.534
Hey, now there's a thought.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.035
HECU: Get down!

00:01:18.035 --> 00:01:19.830
Damn, the bottom part's locked.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.448
What does this d--

00:01:20.448 --> 00:01:23.015
[heavy explosion]
I think I did something.

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:25.167
[heavy explosion]
Shit, I think they noticed me.

00:01:25.928 --> 00:01:27.738
I AM NOT REAL!

00:01:27.738 --> 00:01:28.367
Ah!

00:01:29.059 --> 00:01:31.393
NONE OF THIS IS REAL!

00:01:31.393 --> 00:01:32.033
Ah!

00:01:32.308 --> 00:01:34.060
THIS IS ALL YOUR HEAD!

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.367
FOLLOW THE SOUND OF MY .50 CALIBER!

00:01:37.741 --> 00:01:38.701
OVER HERE!

00:01:40.335 --> 00:01:43.514
How is this gun NOT shooting
through a tool cabinet?

00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:46.801
Does Snap-on have a special
tankproof model or something?

00:01:48.382 --> 00:01:49.267
[yelling]

00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:50.601
All right.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.518
Well, I'm satisfied.

00:01:53.518 --> 00:01:56.623
Through the power of
hypnotic suggestion and a tank

00:01:56.623 --> 00:01:59.514
I was able to convince all these
people they were dead.

00:01:59.514 --> 00:02:00.632
And, let's be honest.

00:02:00.632 --> 00:02:05.067
Whether they're real or not has no
bearing on whether they SHOULD be real.

00:02:06.144 --> 00:02:07.871
Oh...

00:02:07.871 --> 00:02:09.223
FOLLOW THE HAPPY BALL!

00:02:09.223 --> 00:02:11.334
WHAT COULD IT BE?!
LET'S GO TAKE A LOOK!

00:02:11.921 --> 00:02:12.999
NO!

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:13.667
YOU DIDN'T--

00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:24.133
YOU WERE SUPPOSED TO FOLLOW THE HAPPY BALL
BUT YOU DIDN'T! NOW, NO ONE'S HAPPY!

00:02:26.022 --> 00:02:27.843
[agrunt moans]

00:02:27.843 --> 00:02:28.884
[agrunt moans]
YEAH! THAT'S RIGHT!

00:02:28.884 --> 00:02:31.767
BET YOU WISHED YOU PICKED UP
THE HAPPY BALL NOW, HUH?!

00:02:33.803 --> 00:02:34.868
Are you kidding me?

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.632
Why is everybody standing
here waiting for me?

00:02:39.632 --> 00:02:40.831
[Xenian cannon fires]

00:02:40.831 --> 00:02:41.615
[Xenian cannon fires]
FUCK!

00:02:41.615 --> 00:02:42.601
[Xenian cannon fires]

00:02:48.723 --> 00:02:51.695
That'll teach you to...
cave in the ceiling.

00:02:51.695 --> 00:02:53.097
[Xenian cannon fires]

00:02:53.097 --> 00:02:54.565
Mmmm... mmmm!

00:02:54.565 --> 00:02:58.608
Blue space lasers comin' in here
actin' like they own the planet.

00:02:58.608 --> 00:02:59.256
[Xenian cannon fires]
AAAH!

00:02:59.256 --> 00:03:02.015
[Xenian cannon fires]

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.623
Give me a break!

00:03:03.623 --> 00:03:04.895
[Xenian cannon fires]

00:03:04.895 --> 00:03:07.033
Okay, so, what do we know about you?

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.196
You're blue.

00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:09.614
You're dangerous.

00:03:09.614 --> 00:03:10.467
Therefore...

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:11.067
Waah...!

00:03:12.202 --> 00:03:16.187
See, this is why I'm such a
good theoretical physicist.

00:03:16.187 --> 00:03:20.163
I solve problems that shouldn't
even exist to begin with.

00:03:20.163 --> 00:03:24.897
I still don't get it. The aliens kept coming
at me one by one around the corner.

00:03:24.897 --> 00:03:27.087
That makes no tactical sense at all.

00:03:27.087 --> 00:03:30.849
They should've either all come at
once or all held back to ambush me.

00:03:30.849 --> 00:03:32.280
I mean, I'm glad they didn't,

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:35.847
but, wow, they're not impressing
me with their intelligence.

00:03:35.847 --> 00:03:39.958
In science fiction, the usual assumption
is aliens are either just monsters

00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:42.141
or else way more advanced.

00:03:42.141 --> 00:03:47.003
There's not a whole lot on invading
aliens that just are kind of stupid.

00:03:47.003 --> 00:03:48.874
Oh, is this another one
of those giant lifts

00:03:48.874 --> 00:03:51.604
designed to move elephants
underground or something?

00:03:51.604 --> 00:03:53.095
Yep, sure is.

00:03:53.095 --> 00:03:57.066
Okay, so where's the secret vent where
the aliens pop out as soon as you start it?

00:03:57.066 --> 00:03:59.124
The last one was designed that way.

00:03:59.124 --> 00:04:01.532
May as well get a head start
on it this time.

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:02.534
Hey, what's that?

00:04:04.784 --> 00:04:06.300
Does this release the aliens?

00:04:07.545 --> 00:04:10.693
Oh, that's the door. I guess I
should've realized that one.

00:04:10.693 --> 00:04:12.588
Actually, I don't even know
why I'm even worried.

00:04:12.588 --> 00:04:15.252
They'll just send the aliens
after me one by one.

00:04:15.252 --> 00:04:19.264
When I turned the corner, that
one alien seemed surprised to see me.

00:04:19.264 --> 00:04:22.834
How could it not know I was
there? I fired a tank!

00:04:23.501 --> 00:04:25.167
Okay, go-go-go-go-GO!

00:04:26.249 --> 00:04:27.403
Huh.

00:04:27.403 --> 00:04:30.968
Man, I hope I haven't screw my
DNA because of that radiation.

00:04:31.492 --> 00:04:32.303
Oh.

00:04:32.303 --> 00:04:35.026
I remember watching a
documentary on Chernobyl

00:04:35.026 --> 00:04:39.321
and it showed the camera crew
going to the edge of the "safe zone".

00:04:39.321 --> 00:04:43.102
Then, on the drive back, their
Geiger counter kept clicking like crazy

00:04:43.102 --> 00:04:46.258
and everybody had this "Oh shit!"
look on their face

00:04:46.258 --> 00:04:51.000
because nobody factored in their
car and gear ABSORBING the radiation.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.397
STOP DISTRACTING ME!

00:04:54.397 --> 00:04:55.067
AAAH!

00:04:59.543 --> 00:05:01.000
No! No! NO!

00:05:01.495 --> 00:05:02.621
WAAAH!

00:05:02.621 --> 00:05:03.990
BLAAAAGH!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.865
[bullsquid moans]

00:05:05.865 --> 00:05:07.468
SLIMED!

00:05:07.468 --> 00:05:10.522
Yeah, I'm not understanding
this invasion at all.

00:05:10.522 --> 00:05:14.306
I mean, it's obvious at least some of
these teleportations are no accident.

00:05:14.306 --> 00:05:17.071
Then, why am I fighting alien wildlife?

00:05:17.071 --> 00:05:21.852
That would be like if we dropped in a bunch
of stray dogs and badgers into a warzone.

00:05:21.852 --> 00:05:23.067
[headcrab squeals]
Sure it would--WAAH!

00:05:25.516 --> 00:05:28.724
...it would cause SOME problems
but nothing significant.

00:05:28.724 --> 00:05:33.767
Definitely not worth the energy to actually
teleport something. It must take a lot.

00:05:34.873 --> 00:05:39.500
Now, maybe these aliens carry viruses
they thought would spread--oh, nice--

00:05:40.212 --> 00:05:43.496
but, if so, Black Mesa is the
worst place to hit:

00:05:43.496 --> 00:05:49.217
low population, lots of lockdowns,
in the middle of a desert. It's stupid.

00:05:49.217 --> 00:05:54.205
Maybe humanity is just MUCH
better at invading than aliens are.

00:05:54.205 --> 00:05:55.934
We've had a lot of practice.

00:05:57.839 --> 00:06:02.200
Although, we've been acting pretty
stupid ourselves--okay, what is this?

00:06:03.266 --> 00:06:05.634
Do I really want to go in this door?

00:06:06.282 --> 00:06:07.634
No.

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:08.834
No, I don't.

00:06:11.448 --> 00:06:14.906
If I only had gotten that tank to move.

00:06:14.906 --> 00:06:18.200
I-I-I can't think about it;
it just depresses me.

